.TH GRINTION-HELP 1 "November 2026" "Grintion-OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
grintion-help \- Error catalog lookup and documentation assistant
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B grintion-help
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIERROR_CODE\fR | \fITOPIC\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B grintion-help
queries the Grintion-OS error catalog and documentation topics, explaining causes and providing actionable remediation steps for system, bootloader, package manager, and security errors.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB--list\fR
List all cataloged error codes.
.TP
\fB--search\fR \fIKEYWORD\fR
Search error catalog by keyword.
.TP
\fB--json\fR
Output results in machine-readable JSON format.
.SH AUTHORS
Grintion-OS Core Team.

